</math> from both sides of the given equation yields <math alttext="9 left parenthesis 4 minus 3 x right parenthesis equals 8 left parenthesis 4 minus 3 x right parenthesis plus 16"><mn>9</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn></math>. Subtracting <math alttext="8 left parenthesis 4 minus 3 x right parenthesis"><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> from both sides of this equation yields <math alttext="9 left parenthesis 4 minus 3 x right parenthesis minus 8 left parenthesis 4 minus 3 x right parenthesis equals 16"><mn>9</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math>, which gives <math alttext="1 left parenthesis 4 minus 3 x right parenthesis equals 16"><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math>,&nbsp;or <math alttext="4 minus 3 x equals 16"><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math>.&nbsp;Therefore, the value of <math alttext="4 minus 3 x"><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></math> is <math alttext="16"><mn>16</mn>
</math>.</p>
<p>Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>
<p>Choice B is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext="x"><mi>x</mi>
</math>, not <math alttext="4 minus 3 x"><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></math>.</p>
