lass=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/0121a235/img_017_78338560.png\" alt=\"2 comma 0\"></span>. Since <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/0121a235/img_018_77f6a639.png\" alt=\"the points with coordinates negative 1 comma 0\"></span> and <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/0121a235/img_019_60274d07.png\" alt=\"2 comma 0 \"></span> are <span class=\"italic\">x</span>-intercepts, it follows that <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/0121a235/img_020_12275301.png\" alt=\"open parenthesis, x plus 1, close parenthesis \"></span> and <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/0121a235/img_021_a3e28704.png\" alt=\"open parenthesis, x minus 2, close parenthesis\"></span> are factors of the polynomial equation. This is because when <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/0121a235/img_022_921f97f2.png\" alt=\"x equals negative 1\"></span>, the value of <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/0121a235/img_023_c4ad0a02.png\" alt=\"x plus 1 \"></span> is 0. Similarly, when <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr