sent in the table. Choice C is incorrect. The factors <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/0121a235/img_031_0dd43f7e.png\" alt=\"x minus 1 \"></span> and <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/0121a235/img_032_7d703756.png\" alt=\"x plus 2 \"></span> correspond to <span class=\"italic\">x</span>-intercepts <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/0121a235/img_033_8deb0015.png\" alt=\"with coordinates 1 comma 0\"></span> and <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/0121a235/img_034_820bb7cb.png\" alt=\"negative 2 comma 0\"></span>, respectively, which aren&rsquo;t present in the table.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></p>\n","answer_style":"Multiple Choice","section":"Math","image_count":35,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1691007959619,"pPcc":"SAT#P","questionId":"0121a235","skill_cd":"P.C.","score_band_range_cd":7,"skill_desc":"Nonlinear functions","createDate":1691007959619,"program":"SAT","primary_class_cd_desc":"Advanced Math","ibn":"025785-DC","external_id":null,"primary_class_cd":"P","uId":"777ac121-3311-43b0-9ee4-8bacd40dbd91","difficulty":"H"},"raw_detail":{"item_id":"025785-DC","section":"Math","body":"<!--?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?--><div class=\"stimulus_reference \" xmlns=\"http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/apip/apipv1p0/qtiitem/imsqti_v2p1\"><div><table class=\"tableWithBorder\"><tbody><tr><td>x</td><td><span class=\"italic \">p</span>(<span class=\"italic \">x</span>)</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"